OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening with some pleasant evening
OL,7,Fsunshine, then dry overnight with
OL,8,Flengthy clear spells. Some lower cloud
OL,9,Fpossible over the Pennines. Not quite
OL,10,Fas chilly as recent nights.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FStaying dry, with spells of
OL,13,Fwarm sunshine and light to moderate
OL,14,Feasterly winds. Low cloud returning to
OL,15,Fthe hills overnight with winds turning
OL,16,Fincreasingly gusty here and around
OL,17,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
