OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FLow
OL,6,Fpressure moving in from the southwest
OL,7,Fwill bring an unsettled period, with
OL,8,Fheavy downpours and thunderstorms
OL,9,Flikely each day. Turning increasingly
OL,10,Fhumid, with temperatures staying a
OL,11,Flittle above average.
